                "type": "code",
                "text": "  01  const permits = Semaphore.makeUnsafe(2);\n  02  const executeTask = Effect.tryPromise({\n  03    try: async () => task(context),\n  04    catch: (error) => error,\n  05  });\n▶ 06  const program = permits.withPermit(executeTask);\n  07  Effect.runPromise(program);"
